# Example: economy trade node on NPC
# 1) Hierarchy → add SCRIPT «economy» to the scene (declare)
# 2) On an NPC → Экономика → Торговля, fill items, toggle «Можно трейдить»
# 3) Run scene → right-click NPC → trade UI (currency item, not savedData coins)

# Or in code:
# create economy shop {
#     parent = myNpc
#     canTrade = true
#     title = "Кузнец"
#     items = [
#         { item = "minecraft:iron_ingot", name = "Железо", buyPrice = 20, sellPrice = 8, canBuy = true, canSell = true }
#     ]
# }
